# Default: normalize source to LF in the working tree on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The skill's integrity model hashes these files byte-for-byte:
# embedded-manifest.json records a SHA-256 per protected file and the runtime
# fails closed on mismatch. Some of them legitimately contain CRLF inside their
# content, so ANY end-of-line conversion -- in either direction, on add or on
# checkout -- changes the hash and breaks the skill. Mark them as binary so git
# stores and restores the exact bytes.
skills/product-engineering/run-web-product-workflow/assets/** -text
skills/product-engineering/run-web-product-workflow/references/** -text
